s 1, 3, and 4, the young men are physically close to Mikhail, with hands on his shoulders or arms, indicating familiarity and a friendly, persuasive approach. In Frame 1, one man gestures with his hand as if explaining or inviting.\n    *   In Frames 5, 6, 7, and 8, the young men are leaning in towards Mikhail, engaging him in a direct, personal conversation within the indoor setting (which appears to be a bar or club). Their focused attention on him reinforces the idea that they are trying to convince him.\n\n4.  **Contextual Setting:**\n    *   The conversation about the beach (Frames 5-8) takes place inside a venue with red lighting and chandeliers, likely a bar or club. This suggests they are trying to persuade him to leave this location and go to the beach.\n    *   Later frames (9, 10, 11) show the group outside at night, in a crowded public space with festive flags, possibly a street festival or outdoor event. This could be the location they are currently at, or a stop on their way to the beach, further indicating movement and a plan to go somewhere specific.\n\nThere are no visible signs or text in the frames indicating other destinations like a pub, hotel, or swimming pool. The only specific location mentioned is the **beach**.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nThe young men are actively inviting and persuading Mikhail to join them at the **beach**. They use direct verbal invitations, follow-up questions related to the activity (swimming), and physical gestures to encourage him to go. The setting of the conversation (inside a bar/club) implies they are trying to convince him to leave his current location for this new destination.\n'], 'condensed_response': '**Scene Summary (Frames\u202f0789‑0867)**  \n\n- **Characters:**  \n  - **Mikhail** – older man, the focal point of the conversation.  \n  - **Two young men** – a friendly, persuasive pair who repeatedly engage Mikhail.\n\n- **Frames\u202f0789‑0792 (Indoor, red‑lit bar/club):**  \n  - The young men stand close to Mikh